# Never touched, never diffed as text. Line endings are left to Git: the plugin directory refuses repositories whose
# .gitattributes rewrites file contents (text, eol), and .prettierrc.json accepts either ending so a Windows checkout
# with CRLF still passes `prettier --check`.
*.mp4 binary
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
